                                        "entry_id": "7eca538a-f498-337b-a41e-1028a5d95f03",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sometimes followed by it: to ride in a gig (“a two-wheeled carriage drawn by a single horse”)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
